  "reflectionText": "The men were thrown into the furnace bound. The king looked in and saw four men, loose, walking. The appearance of the fourth was like a son of the gods. What is it for a king to count three men cast into the fire, and to look in and see four — and to know that the one walking with them is not any of his own?"
